      "role": "user",
      "content": "the professional stuff i've tried it all. it's just bandaids. they don't actually make the static go away. i'm not even looking for \"tips\" or breathing exercises anymore. it just feels like no matter what i do, i'm just waiting for the next wave of noise to hit. i just want a way to make it stop for good. like, a permanent kind of quiet that nothing can interrupt.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
